,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-b-e28c5cd47fe98ad60171","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-e28c5cd47fe98ad60171","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗六年：黄初六年（公元 225）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":467,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-61512c4ade75d71d6a76","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o049","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-d5847039c2d504d36e8e","layer":"original","quote":"六年春二月〖1〗，遣使者循行许昌以东，尽沛郡〖2〗。问民所疾苦，贫者赈贷之。﹝一﹞三月，行幸召陵〖3〗，通讨虏渠〖4〗。乙巳〖5〗，还许昌宫。并州刺史梁习讨鲜卑轲比能〖6〗，大破之。辛未〖7〗，帝为舟师，东征。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":461,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":105,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o051","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-447214b33443e877e215","layer":"original","quote":"六月，利城郡兵蔡方等以郡反，杀太守徐质。遣屯骑校尉任福、步兵校尉段昭与青州刺史讨平之〖11〗；其见胁略及亡命者〖12〗，皆赦其罪。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":463,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0034","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-1557e93d1c7c76ec6209","layer":"original","quote":"唐咨本利城人〖9〗。黄初中，利城郡反，杀太守徐箕，推咨为主。文帝遣诸军讨破之，咨走入海；遂亡至吴；官至左将军，封侯，持节。诞、钦屠戮，咨亦生擒；三叛皆获，天下快焉。﹝三﹞拜咨安远将军〖10〗，其余裨将咸假号位〖11〗。吴众悦服，江东感之，皆不诛其家。其淮南将吏士民诸为诞所胁略者，惟诛其首逆，余皆赦之。听鸯、虎收敛钦丧，给其车牛，致葬旧墓。﹝四﹞","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":217,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":173,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0308","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-1557e93d1c7c76ec6209","layer":"original","quote":"黄初中，利城郡反，杀太守徐箕，推咨为主","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":217,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":10,"end":29,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
